title: "06 — Planning and Task Loop (proposed; solid = MVP; dashed = post-MVP scheduling)"
---
%% Legend: stateDiagram of TASK lifecycle (WORKFLOW-STATE-MACHINES §4). All transitions server-enforced.
%% Req IDs: TASK-001..010, PLAN-001/002, NFR-005/007.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft : planning generates (PLAN-001)<br/>or user steers via chat (PLAN-002)
  draft --> planned : traces to milestone
  planned --> queued : run request → preflight (credit cost,<br/>side-effect class) + policy №1 (TASK-004)
  queued --> running : worker pickup → policy №3 (mandatory)<br/>+ stop-state clear + company active
  running --> waiting_for_input : question for user
  waiting_for_input --> running : answer given
  running --> waiting_for_approval : gated tool call proposed
  waiting_for_approval --> running : approved (hash-bound)
  waiting_for_approval --> cancelled : rejected / expired / revoked
  running --> blocked_by_policy : policy deny (fail closed)
  running --> completed : artifact persisted (TASK-005)<br/>+ usage finalized
  running --> failed : retries exhausted →<br/>failure detail mandatory (TASK-006)
  running --> paused : company pause / emergency stop<br/>(safe-stop, held visibly)
  paused --> running : resume after review (ADMIN-002)
  queued --> cancelled : user cancel
  running --> cancelled : stop request → safe-stop (TASK-007)
  completed --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
